{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q419784","formula":"BrF₃","hill":"BrF3","elements":["F","Br"],"composition":{"F":3.0,"Br":1.0},"names":{"en":"Bromine trifluoride","ru":"Фторид брома(III)"},"descriptions":{"en":"Bromine trifluoride is an interhalogen compound with the formula BrF3. At room temperature, it is a straw-coloured liquid with a pungent odor which decomposes violently on contact with water and organic compounds. It is a powerful fluorinating agent and an ionizing inorganic solvent.","ru":"Фтори́д бро́ма(III) (трифтори́д бро́ма, трёхфто́ристый бром) BrF3 — соединение брома с фтором, представляющее собой при комнатной температуре подвижную бесцветную жидкость, иногда окрашенную желтовато-серым или соломенным цветом (за счёт разложения вещества с образованием бурого брома), дымящую на воздухе. Обладает сильным раздражающим запахом. В больших концентрациях ядовит."},"fame":26,"pubchemCid":24594,"mass":136.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"FBr(F)F","inchikey":"FQFKTKUFHWNTBN-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"trifluoro-lambda3-bromane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q419784","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bromine_trifluoride","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A4%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B0%28III%29","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24594","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bromine_trifluoride.png","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q417069","formula":"BrF₅","names":{"en":"Bromine pentafluoride","ru